Catalog Expansion Strategy
Why Multiple Target Categories Are Needed

A single target cannot be evaluated in isolation.

For example:

KIC 8462852 brightness variability


may appear unusual until compared against:

known variable stars
nearby stars
exoplanet host stars
calibration/control stars

Quiet Sky therefore uses population comparisons rather than absolute measurements.

The objective is not to determine whether a target is unusual in general.

The objective is to determine whether a target is unusual relative to similar objects.

