Ultimate Vision

Quiet Sky is not intended to become a catalog of unusual objects.

Quiet Sky is intended to become a repeatable scientific framework capable of continuously ingesting new targets, comparing them against a growing reference population, and identifying objects that deserve further human investigation.

The catalog is therefore not a fixed dataset.

It is a continuously expanding astronomical observatory archive and anomaly detection platform.